      "files": {
        "16a36e8c-b751-4bfb-86ba-57e99bd9b84b": {
          "id": "16a36e8c-b751-4bfb-86ba-57e99bd9b84b",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Breaking Down the Generate and Judge Guide</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <h1>Breaking Down the Generate and Judge Guide</h1>\n\n  <p>In the previous level, you explored an example Generate and Judge Guide created by a student. This level breaks down the major sections of the project and highlights how students apply the big ideas from across the unit.</p>\n\n  <p>As you review each section, notice how the student moves beyond simple reactions about AI and instead makes evidence-based judgments about responsible AI use.</p>\n\n  <section class=\"stepper\" aria-label=\"Guide sections\">\n    <div class=\"stepper-viewport\">\n      <article class=\"guide-page\" data-title=\"Opening Section\">\n        <h2 tabindex=\"-1\">Opening Section</h2>\n        <div class=\"guide-page-body\">\n          <div class=\"guide-page-text\">\n            <p>This opening section introduces the topic, audience, and purpose of the guide.</p>\n            <p>By choosing a specific audience and focus, the student creates a clearer foundation for the project.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"guide-page-image\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.code.org/301915f70ff79c5244d0f23356f43526-image-1789581224499.51.15%E2%80%AFAM.png\" alt=\"Audience, theme, and purpose of the AI Guide\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"guide-page\" data-title=\"Helpful vs. Unhelpful AI Use\" hidden>\n        <h2 tabindex=\"-1\">Helpful vs. Unhelpful AI Use</h2>\n        <div class=\"guide-page-body\">\n          <div class=\"guide-page-text\">\n            <p>This section helps students compare responsible and irresponsible uses of AI.</p>\n            <p>The student explains both the benefits and risks while emphasizing that humans are responsible for what gets shared.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"guide-page-image\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.code.org/7caea9abdda3243728294d253ff9668a-image-1789581176667.51.33%E2%80%AFAM.png\" alt=\"Chat examples of helpful AI use\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"guide-page\" data-title=\"Chatbot Evidence\" hidden>\n        <h2 tabindex=\"-1\">Chatbot Evidence</h2>\n        <div class=\"guide-page-body\">\n          <div class=\"guide-page-text\">\n            <p>This section gives students the opportunity to test and evaluate AI-generated responses.</p>\n            <p>The student analyzes the chatbot's output, identifies strengths and weaknesses, and explains why human judgment is still necessary.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"guide-page-image\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.code.org/92d376ffb21210bc040093d2a526b30a-image-1789581176588.52.12%E2%80%AFAM.png\" alt=\"Logs of custom chatbot use\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"guide-page\" data-title=\"Image Generation\" hidden>\n        <h2 tabindex=\"-1\">Image Generation</h2>\n        <div class=\"guide-page-body\">\n          <div class=\"guide-page-text\">\n            <p>This section encourages students to think critically about AI-generated images and misinformation.</p>\n            <p>The student reflects on audience trust, realism, and the responsibility creators have when sharing AI-generated media.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"guide-page-image\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.code.org/4df6538bfb67eb82df279ee81e24dc17-image-1789581176629.51.59%E2%80%AFAM.png\" alt=\"A generated image and tips for image generation\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"guide-page\" data-title=\"Tips for Responsible Use\" hidden>\n        <h2 tabindex=\"-1\">Tips for Responsible Use</h2>\n        <div class=\"guide-page-body\">\n          <div class=\"guide-page-text\">\n            <p>This final section synthesizes ideas from across the unit into practical advice for others.</p>\n            <p>The student connects recommendations back to earlier investigations and demonstrates evidence-based reasoning about AI use.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"guide-page-image\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.code.org/bd82c2d4b5c048628d1f22a2d5e9837f-image-1789581176613.52.18%E2%80%AFAM.png\" alt=\"Four final tips for responsible use\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bubble-stepper\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Section progress\">\n      <span class=\"bubble\" role=\"listitem\" aria-current=\"step\"></span>\n      <span class=\"bubble\" role=\"listitem\"></span>\n      <span class=\"bubble\" role=\"listitem\"></span>\n      <span class=\"bubble\" role=\"listitem\"></span>\n      <span class=\"bubble\" role=\"listitem\"></span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stepper-controls\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"prev-button\" class=\"stepper-button stepper-button-secondary\" hidden>Previous</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"next-button\" class=\"stepper-button stepper-button-primary\">Next</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"visually-hidden\" id=\"stepper-announcer\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></div>\n</main>\n<script src=\"script.js\" defer></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "folderId": "0",
          "type": "starter",
          "active": true
        },
        "41ec3f27-b34f-40e8-af8d-e63d348e73d8": {
          "id": "41ec3f27-b34f-40e8-af8d-e63d348e73d8",
          "name": "style.css",
          "contents": ":root {\n  --purple-light: #E4E2F8;\n  --purple-mid: #ACA8EA;\n  --purple-primary: #4C42CF;\n  --purple-dark: #1F1976;\n  --white: #FFFFFF;\n  --heading-color: #4C42CF;\n  --body-text: #333333;\n  --focus-ring: #ACA8EA;\n  --shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: system-ui, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n  color: var(--body-text);\n  background-color: var(--white);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.page {\n  max-width: 800px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 24px 20px 40px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 28px);\n  margin: 0 0 16px;\n  color: var(--heading-color);\n}\n\nh2 {\n  font-size: clamp(18px, 3.5vw, 22px);\n  margin: 0 0 16px;\n  color: var(--heading-color);\n}\n\nh2:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--focus-ring);\n  outline-offset: 4px;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0 0 12px;\n}\n\n.stepper {\n  margin-top: 28px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--purple-light);\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n  padding: 20px;\n  background-color: var(--white);\n}\n\n.guide-page {\n  animation: fade-in 200ms ease-in;\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .guide-page {\n    animation: none;\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes fade-in {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n}\n\n.guide-page-body {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\n.guide-page-image img {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n}\n\n.stepper-controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  padding-top: 20px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--purple-light);\n}\n\n.bubble-stepper {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  margin-top: 24px;\n}\n\n.bubble {\n  width: 10px;\n  height: 10px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background-color: var(--purple-light);\n}\n\n.bubble[aria-current=\"step\"] {\n  width: 14px;\n  height: 14px;\n  background-color: var(--purple-primary);\n}\n\n#next-button {\n  margin-inline-start: auto;\n}\n\n.stepper-button {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 10px 22px;\n  min-height: 44px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: 2px solid transparent;\n}\n\n.stepper-button-primary {\n  background-color: var(--purple-primary);\n  color: var(--white);\n  border-color: var(--purple-primary);\n}\n\n.stepper-button-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background-color: var(--purple-dark);\n  border-color: var(--purple-dark);\n}\n\n.stepper-button-secondary {\n  background-color: transparent;\n  color: var(--purple-dark);\n  border-color: var(--purple-light);\n}\n\n.stepper-button-secondary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background-color: var(--purple-light);\n}\n\n.stepper-button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--focus-ring);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.visually-hidden {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 1px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: -1px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  border: 0;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "type": "starter",
          "active": false
        },
        "370714ac-f221-4af0-8d2e-16a3dec184dd": {
          "id": "370714ac-f221-4af0-8d2e-16a3dec184dd",
          "name": "script.js",
          "contents": "document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n  const pages = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\".guide-page\"));\n  const prevButton = document.getElementById(\"prev-button\");\n  const nextButton = document.getElementById(\"next-button\");\n  const bubbles = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\".bubble\"));\n  const announcer = document.getElementById(\"stepper-announcer\");\n\n  let currentIndex = 0;\n\n  function showPage(index, moveFocus) {\n    pages.forEach((page, i) => {\n      if (i === index) {\n        page.hidden = false;\n      } else {\n        page.hidden = true;\n      }\n    });\n\n    bubbles.forEach((bubble, i) => {\n      if (i === index) {\n        bubble.setAttribute(\"aria-current\", \"step\");\n      } else {\n        bubble.removeAttribute(\"aria-current\");\n      }\n    });\n\n    const title = pages[index].dataset.title;\n    const totalPages = pages.length;\n\n    announcer.textContent = `Now showing: ${title}`;\n\n    prevButton.hidden = index === 0;\n    nextButton.hidden = index === totalPages - 1;\n\n    if (moveFocus) {\n      const heading = pages[index].querySelector(\"h2\");\n      if (heading) {\n        heading.focus();\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  prevButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n    if (currentIndex > 0) {\n      currentIndex -= 1;\n      showPage(currentIndex, true);\n    }\n  });\n\n  nextButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n    if (currentIndex < pages.length - 1) {\n      currentIndex += 1;\n      showPage(currentIndex, true);\n    }\n  });\n\n  showPage(currentIndex, false);\n});",
          "folderId": "0",
          "type": "starter",
          "active": false
        }
      },
